  "title": "· New Bags | Bottega Veneta Launches Japan-Exclusive Moomin Collaboration: Tales from Moominvalley ·",
  "original_title": "新包 | Bottega Veneta 日本限定发售 Moomin 合作系列手袋：姆明谷的故事",
  "excerpt": "Bottega Veneta launches a limited-edition Moomin capsule collection in Japan from November 11, featuring leather weaving and comic-strip motifs.",
  "author": "撰稿 X Vivi 编辑 X RAN",
  "date_iso": "2026-11-11",
  "date_label": "November 11, 2026",
