      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "From November 11, Bottega Veneta will release a limited-edition Moomin capsule collection in Japan. Drawing on the Moomin novels and comic strips created by Finnish author and illustrator Tove Jansson, the pieces bring the beloved characters to life through leather weaving and print techniques — including Moominmamma's signature red-and-white striped apron and black-and-white comic-strip motifs — inviting us into the comforting fairy-tale world of Moominvalley.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
