    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Red & White Stripes ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/fzk67ae/917fac8bf5a444ff.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/fzk67ae/84d39a01ce83eb7b.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The capsule comprises 23 pieces, and the standouts are this group of bags in a red-and-white striped print inspired by Moominmamma's signature apron. The range includes the Mini Anadimao, Dustbag, Baby Campana and Giorno bags, along with small leather goods such as zip-around wallets and card cases. Crafted in the house's signature Intrecciato woven leather, they create a distinctive zigzag effect, while the bold red-and-white palette is full of playful charm — and perfectly timed for the fast-approaching Christmas season.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
