      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The small Cabat tote takes its design cue from the cover of the 1951 English-language edition of Comet in Moominland, pairing a white Intrecciato woven body with a detachable red inner pouch. The same theme extends to a notebook printed with the original cover artwork, crafted in woven leather. First published in 1946, Comet in Moominland is the second novel in the Moomin series, following Moomintroll and Sniff as they journey to an observatory to uncover the truth about a comet hurtling toward Earth, meeting new companions Snufkin and Snork Maiden along the way.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
