    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Bauletto travel bag and wallet are made with a white Intrecciato woven leather body, and their standout detail is a leather tassel trim on the zipper, evoking the Moomins' fluffy tails. The tail is an important way for the Moomin family to express emotion — they wag it when happy, and cry \"Bless my tail!\" when misfortune strikes or they get a fright.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
