      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This passport case is inspired by a sketch Tove Jansson made during her visit to Japan in 1970, depicting Moomintroll in a Japanese yukata with a Japanese teacup beside him. Jansson drew the sketch when she was invited to the home of Finnish diplomat to Japan Kari Härkönen and made it for his five-year-old son, Jari.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
