      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This envelope-style wallet draws its inspiration from the Moominhouse, rendered in a striking red-and-blue color clash — the red triangular flap echoing the house's pointed red roof. The capsule also includes a set of dolls and bag charms crafted with BV's signature leather weaving technique, featuring not only Moomintroll, Moominmamma and the Moominhouse but also Snufkin, the wandering philosopher in his green pointed hat — with winter coming, it's time for him to set off alone for the south once more.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
